{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01D4eTvQbSVxzZCAdzVaoPNm","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# tri-planner\n2\t\n3\tGenerates structured triathlon workouts and pushes them to Intervals.icu, which\n4\texports them to the athlete's Garmin watch through Garmin Connect.\n5\t\n6\t- `gen.py` turns a plan (`plans/*.json`) into the body for\n7\t  `POST /api/v1/athlete/{id}/events` (an event with `workout_doc`).\n8\t- `push.sh` posts it (needs `INTERVALS_API_KEY` and `ATHLETE_ID`).\n9\t- `readback/` holds what the API returned for the last pushed event and\n10\t  notes on what the watch displayed.\n11\t\n12\tAthlete thresholds live in Intervals (LTHR 172 for this athlete). HR targets\n13\tin plans are percentages of LTHR; Intervals converts them to bpm at export.\n14\t\n15\t```\n16\tpython3 gen.py plans/tempo-run.json > event.json\n17\t./push.sh event.json\n18\t```\n19\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c6958080-76eb-49cb-af60-676336537b9c","uuid":"a39525aa-424e-4804-8bb3-580daf8c2d86","timestamp":"2026-10-27T03:21:37.349Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/tmp/h-e90bOf/README.md","content":"# tri-planner\n\nGenerates structured triathlon workouts and pushes them to Intervals.icu, which\nexports them to the athlete's Garmin watch through Garmin Connect.\n\n- `gen.py` turns a plan (`plans/*.json`) into the body for\n  `POST /api/v1/athlete/{id}/events` (an event with `workout_doc`).\n- `push.sh` posts it (needs `INTERVALS_API_KEY` and `ATHLETE_ID`).\n- `readback/` holds what the API returned for the last pushed event and\n  notes on what the watch displayed.\n\nAthlete thresholds live in Intervals (LTHR 172 for this athlete). HR targets\nin plans are percentages of LTHR; Intervals converts them to bpm at export.\n\n```\npython3 gen.py plans/tempo-run.json > event.json\n./push.sh event.json\n```\n","numLines":19,"startLine":1,"totalLines":19}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01D4eTvQbSVxzZCAdzVaoPNm","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
